# Security

- Hash passwords with argon2. Store refresh tokens hashed. Rotate on refresh. Revoke on logout.
- HTTP-only cookies for tokens. Never `localStorage` for passwords or refresh tokens.
- DTO validation, Helmet, CORS allowlist, rate limiting.
- File uploads: allowlist jpeg/png/webp, 5MB max, ignore client MIME/filename.
- Ownership on every mutating property/image/inquiry/visit operation.
- Admin-only role changes. Agents cannot escalate themselves.
- No secrets in git. No stack traces in production responses.
- Frontend role checks are UX only.
